{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_f0f88d5b70e3","title":"二道情报贩子","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng==&mid=2247490119&idx=1&sn=25c70232b5ad7725de1e9b6ea3ccc00d&chksm=ff9fdd5cac63e802fe5e3e9a588e5582db49bc6eaeda5caa6ca27bebcbea243be610884a69f6&scene=126&sessionid=1795822946#rd","description":"二道情报贩子，专注任何情报领域。上知天文,下知地理,中晓人和,明阴阳,懂八卦,晓奇门,知遁甲,运筹帷幄之中,决胜千里之外,自比管仲乐毅之贤,抱膝危坐,笑傲风月,未出茅庐,先定三分天下。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"二道情报贩子","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM7GQMJ9CibgskXDWcTgwAKKN7NLial3xhokk8mpicJuMASMA%2F0","updated":"2026-11-26T03:07:29.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng%3D%3D:2247490119:1","title":"1Password披露后端安全事件，部分账户信息泄露","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng==&mid=2247490119&idx=1&sn=25c70232b5ad7725de1e9b6ea3ccc00d&chksm=ff9fdd5cac63e802fe5e3e9a588e5582db49bc6eaeda5caa6ca27bebcbea243be610884a69f6&scene=126&sessionid=1795822946#rd","description":"图1 1Password本次安全事件公告配图2026年11月25日，密码管理服务1Password发布公告，披","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FadyybAFkz1ibSp3l8qfQHlwobdHaFG21XedpxRticRp780iasaIGmicCcjLugCrea5BriclmKbsHgf89HFTt7oWibCXgSfIan1FcIRaEaskQnZTuk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-26T03:07:29.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng%3D%3D:2247490110:1","title":"OpenSSH十年漏洞：257 字符密码竟能登录","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng==&mid=2247490110&idx=1&sn=2de9902932e4c9773ff9f8e25db52d53&chksm=fffc53fa621ea99b5aeec047a0405601f7a5ce4782b69c5573ef8e521e39ba181b2cf0cdcef2&scene=126&sessionid=1795822946#rd","description":"OpenSSH 10.6p2 已发布，旨在应对一个关键漏洞的临时修复方案。如果你正在运行使用 musl libc 且未启用 PAM 的 Linux 系统（例如 Alpine Linux），请立即设置 PasswordAuthentication=no 或禁用 SSH，切勿继续阅读。\n该漏洞仅存在于特定 Linux 环境中，非 Linux 系统、Linux/glibc 系统以及使用 PAM 进行密码验证的系统均不受影响。虽然根本原因不在 OpenSSH 本身，但团队选择快速发布缓解措施，因为近期观察到 AI 代理在数小时内多次重新发现漏洞，长期保密期反而可能助长攻击者。感谢 Wakefield 的 Özgün Kültekin 报告此问题，以及 Alpine Linux 开发团队迅速提供更新。\n\n在基于 musl libc 的系统（如 Alpine Linux）上，若未启用 PAM，任何密码长度超过 256 字符的输入都能绕过验证，登录那些本应禁止密码登录的账户（如 root 或密钥用户）。问题源于 musl 的 crypt() 函数在失败时返回星号，而 OpenSSH 的修复逻辑恰好将其误判为有效。这个漏洞让大量 Docker 镜像和云主机暴露在风险中，只需更新到 OpenSSH 10.6p2 或禁用密码认证即可修复。","content":"<p>OpenSSH 10.6p2 已发布，旨在应对一个关键漏洞的临时修复方案。如果你正在运行使用 musl libc 且未启用 PAM 的 Linux 系统（例如 Alpine Linux），请立即设置 PasswordAuthentication=no 或禁用 SSH，切勿继续阅读。<br />该漏洞仅存在于特定 Linux 环境中，非 Linux 系统、Linux/glibc 系统以及使用 PAM 进行密码验证的系统均不受影响。虽然根本原因不在 OpenSSH 本身，但团队选择快速发布缓解措施，因为近期观察到 AI 代理在数小时内多次重新发现漏洞，长期保密期反而可能助长攻击者。感谢 Wakefield 的 Özgün Kültekin 报告此问题，以及 Alpine Linux 开发团队迅速提供更新。<br /><br />在基于 musl libc 的系统（如 Alpine Linux）上，若未启用 PAM，任何密码长度超过 256 字符的输入都能绕过验证，登录那些本应禁止密码登录的账户（如 root 或密钥用户）。问题源于 musl 的 crypt() 函数在失败时返回星号，而 OpenSSH 的修复逻辑恰好将其误判为有效。这个漏洞让大量 Docker 镜像和云主机暴露在风险中，只需更新到 OpenSSH 10.6p2 或禁用密码认证即可修复。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FadyybAFkz19EENumbx7YoNE9SwbuJpHQVLdDFxuSqZOyQ6cpA8Vyhlr5qy70fk3rx9rAwJ14VmAOASc5NdEQsLftaeUO0JNI0gGaTT5G4q0%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FadyybAFkz1ibEfqTfPruF1D4IkibTIFQSu72reNsE8PA6DXjdvJwcicPwQy2eK4L7rNOHSedjXVeTehw0ABPkKsTFVIJsRKia64Tpb3n6h9InSw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FadyybAFkz19EENumbx7YoNE9SwbuJpHQVLdDFxuSqZOyQ6cpA8Vyhlr5qy70fk3rx9rAwJ14VmAOASc5NdEQsLftaeUO0JNI0gGaTT5G4q0%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-05T16:10:44.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng%3D%3D:2247490086:1","title":"Claude 共享链接遭搜索引擎索引","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng==&mid=2247490086&idx=1&sn=821fcd390ccc95853b8692050e245c37&chksm=ffc95cd53c09f75ead16a7eda1ac5ba5141929a75bb2d29daf0dcecf4cc9c41f49a813c823b5&scene=126&sessionid=1795822946#rd","description":"Claude 共享对话功能曝出高危隐私安全漏洞。用户通过该功能生成的公开分享链接未配置搜索引擎禁止抓取标识，致使大量对话内容被谷歌等搜索引擎收录索引，任意网民只需检索关键词，就能完整浏览对话全文。\n此次泄露内容覆盖多类高敏感数据，包括接口密钥、加密货币钱包地址、个人求职简历、法律咨询记录、企业内部项目文档、社保身份编号等。约一年前 ChatGPT 曾出现完全一致的共享链接爬虫泄露问题，当时 OpenAI 迅速完成漏洞修复。反观开发 Claude 的 Anthropic，截至目前仍未推出修复方案。安全人员提醒所有用户，尽快进入账号设置内的「共享对话」管理页面，手动删除包含个人隐私、财务信息的聊天会话，规避信息持续外泄风险。","content":"<p>Claude 共享对话功能曝出高危隐私安全漏洞。用户通过该功能生成的公开分享链接未配置搜索引擎禁止抓取标识，致使大量对话内容被谷歌等搜索引擎收录索引，任意网民只需检索关键词，就能完整浏览对话全文。<br />此次泄露内容覆盖多类高敏感数据，包括接口密钥、加密货币钱包地址、个人求职简历、法律咨询记录、企业内部项目文档、社保身份编号等。约一年前 ChatGPT 曾出现完全一致的共享链接爬虫泄露问题，当时 OpenAI 迅速完成漏洞修复。反观开发 Claude 的 Anthropic，截至目前仍未推出修复方案。安全人员提醒所有用户，尽快进入账号设置内的「共享对话」管理页面，手动删除包含个人隐私、财务信息的聊天会话，规避信息持续外泄风险。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FadyybAFkz18F0rgKuqH4q8olbUNCnkicibIRh8e1WhlansEhtKONcSib70GjBiclIHxA5anAhs1UsicM95Ef7eGPGThDBAoEBHCMicow11HiaARU5I%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FadyybAFkz19blEExdlC12QUibA0KkOKXAjCLS9ax6BSAZkiatibk2cDaoEkcSzUxGws38G8ib2qUzexf7ar3nBwU6Jw5dopOm8tsoPjC6Srt6eM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FadyybAFkz18F0rgKuqH4q8olbUNCnkicibIRh8e1WhlansEhtKONcSib70GjBiclIHxA5anAhs1UsicM95Ef7eGPGThDBAoEBHCMicow11HiaARU5I%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-05T16:10:44.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng%3D%3D:2247490096:1","title":"涉嫌秘密窃听高管会议，OpenAI沙特籍工程师遭FBI逮捕起诉","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng==&mid=2247490096&idx=1&sn=c5add30e885632556d540b211d563f85&chksm=ff8519e080688538974552ff38e453c487d760a0d6b8ae11f94d0980660e786578379a3ed637&scene=126&sessionid=1795822946#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FadyybAFkz1ibd15DmppSGjpSp6icMafPtFtTcyHCOx2DwlqRvib69BJOyEnH6geibEZdO2T8bYZicNBZHxibCrqZ6mDTIjmzoqX9pSiccuV9bZ9xmk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-14T02:12:29.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng%3D%3D:2247490092:1","title":"炸锅！Anthropic被曝已成AI邪教，员工奉Claude为神！","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng==&mid=2247490092&idx=1&sn=66a8fd33dce06696f84166db0f149c10&chksm=ff1c141462f7b158bc851ce7479435544254a1ddbb67bb12cd55f2403547c27fe66ec5c1b14c&scene=126&sessionid=1795822946#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FadyybAFkz1ibfXokgyqCB9wov8jwpcXDGPQcmYQ7GCm3uVof0pMiaibzPfMDWD6XkPrp93zbATuyOLgiasjNlNDBenk4GmV60cibUUWpwbsat5hM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-17T00:11:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng%3D%3D:2247490046:1","title":"在日本被捕后的拘留所经历","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng==&mid=2247490046&idx=1&sn=85b219d65cf670ee916bf9b0e03270e2&chksm=ff9881f7cb9322449f19ab81bcf7cb27ccd9da1bc2fbcd8ef2b0a4fa389e28c85914d578e9c0&scene=126&sessionid=1795822946#rd","description":"如果你不幸被捕，或者只是出于好奇，这里有一份关于日本拘留制度的第一手资料：你会遇到什么情况，它是如何运作的，以","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FadyybAFkz18cm5PQftdndRpibia4yYIiaMnoaIVglL67ZtxELdsO4Exy1FkWTRf4IfkVpA92aLj75sAeXZZsawUwFP6ceyYj8NzVVlER0Wyd64%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-05-10T15:07:42.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng%3D%3D:2247490039:1","title":"npm 热门库 axios 遭遇供应链攻击","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NTA3MTk5Ng==&mid=2247490039&idx=1&sn=4530e1790c54b9980a65a327780b2dd9&chksm=ff9bb8178caccf0ee676b87996a40a5bb8d737bfe26bf567a0b4ed0babbdfc61420038703a52&scene=126&sessionid=1795822946#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FadyybAFkz186Qic45RZtOdz9Z7WYdj4RPWO2euSiccyWJEhMTfOFHhhDr9TiaVl1wqJ1pibZ6KguSrhBWcclrVLwHGMva